      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Several years ago and frequently later on, I was assured that one of the great factors in the financial success of \"old-man Rockefellow\" was often attributed to his having kept a promise to spend something like 10% of his profits to one or other charitable work. I am quite inclined to take stock in such a report. I have seen the like work out in other cases. Plese pardon my prolongation of this conclusion. I meant to close in just a line or two here.",
